{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["way/696787047","way/445479852","relation/6625647","relation/6625650","relation/9684043"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals and relation 6625650, relation 9684043 from OpenStreetMap, grown by 300 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals and those areas kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Lomé. These are the hull of the terminals below and the two harbour basins, the original basin and the new dock in front of Lomé Container Terminal, grown by 300 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the terminals and basins kept whole and a 30 m margin where they meet the water. What is left is the harbour inside the breakwaters, the sea just outside them and the three terminals. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no homes, residential land, schools, hospitals or places of worship inside; the only named place is Zone Portuaire, a point inside the port's own quays."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[1.273726,6.131479],[1.292053,6.13143],[1.293091,6.131635],[1.293972,6.13222],[1.29456,6.133096],[1.294767,6.134128],[1.29315,6.144806],[1.292943,6.145838],[1.292336,6.146918],[1.291036,6.146404],[1.290608,6.146068],[1.290434,6.145803],[1.290435,6.145072],[1.2897,6.145132],[1.289376,6.145003],[1.289049,6.14507],[1.28885,6.144936],[1.288082,6.148745],[1.288012,6.149142],[1.288003,6.149149],[1.287223,6.149186],[1.287096,6.149279],[1.2869949999999999,6.149138],[1.286989,6.149127],[1.28659,6.148599],[1.286552,6.148563],[1.283728,6.147659],[1.282401,6.147223],[1.282398,6.147214],[1.282659,6.145861],[1.282695,6.145714],[1.282747,6.145551],[1.283011,6.144259],[1.283114,6.14371],[1.283108,6.143683],[1.283063,6.143598],[1.282976,6.143457],[1.282534,6.143088],[1.28228,6.142862],[1.282242,6.142839],[1.2